## Ports.cpp/files the nodes open
a file that is not there: done, reads ""
back: done, reads "3"
changed on disk, the same frame: done, reads "1"
closed by both: throws "a file this node did not open when it last bound", reads ""
closed by one node: done, reads "4"
first read: done, reads "1"
gone: done, reads ""
on disk: [a=4]
opened twice: the same file true
saved through the port: done, reads "4"
the next frame: done, reads "2"

## Ports.cpp/frames of input
a frame after: v a pointer false
handed over a picture, the pointer a quarter in: menu.items.b reads [pointer (150,75)]; other reads [pointer (150,75)]; game's reads [pointer (200,100)]
handed over a picture, the pointer past it: menu.items.b reads [pointer (400,300)]; other reads [pointer (400,300)]; game's reads [pointer (799,399)]
handed to game: menu.items.b reads [button down "right" x1]; other reads []; game's reads [button down "right" x1]
held as the frame before cooked: a view drawn into an image, outside the hold, reads []
held as the frame before cooked: menu.items.b reads [button down "left" x1, wheel (0,1), key down "a"]; other reads [key down "a"]; game's reads [key down "a"]
held as the frame before cooked: menu.items2, named alike but beside the menu, reads [key down "a"]
let go: menu.items.b reads [button down "middle" x1]; other reads [button down "middle" x1]; game's reads [button down "middle" x1]
the frame after: menu.items.b reads []; other reads []; game's reads []
three moves around a press: menu.items.b reads [pointer (2,2), button down "left" x1, pointer (3,3)]; other reads [pointer (2,2), button down "left" x1, pointer (3,3)]; game's reads [pointer (2,2), button down "left" x1, pointer (3,3)]
unread: v a pointer true, v a keys false

## Ports.cpp/key
("") -> "took 0: []"
("\n") -> "took 1: [key down \"enter\", key up \"enter\"]"
("\r") -> "took 1: [key down \"enter\", key up \"enter\"]"
("\t") -> "took 1: [key down \"tab\", key up \"tab\"]"
("\x00") -> "took 1: [key down \"control\", key down \"`\", key up \"`\", key up \"control\"]"
("\x01") -> "took 1: [key down \"control\", key down \"a\", key up \"a\", key up \"control\"]"
("\x08") -> "took 1: [key down \"backspace\", key up \"backspace\"]"
("\x1b") -> "took 0: []"
("\x1bOH") -> "took 3: [key down \"home\", key up \"home\"]"
("\x1b[") -> "took 0: []"
("\x1b[1;5C") -> "took 6: []"
("\x1b[200~") -> "took 6: []"
("\x1b[3~") -> "took 4: [key down \"delete\", key up \"delete\"]"
("\x1b[9~") -> "took 4: []"
("\x1b[A") -> "took 3: [key down \"up\", key up \"up\"]"
("\x1b\x1b[A") -> "took 1: [key down \"escape\", key up \"escape\"]"
("\x1bx") -> "took 1: [key down \"escape\", key up \"escape\"]"
("\x7f") -> "took 1: [key down \"backspace\", key up \"backspace\"]"
("\xc3") -> "took 1: [text \"\\xc3\"]"
("\xc3\xa9") -> "took 2: [text \"\\xc3\\xa9\"]"
("a") -> "took 1: [text \"a\"]"
("a\rb") -> "took 1: [text \"a\"]"
("ab\x1b[D") -> "took 2: [text \"ab\"]"
("abc") -> "took 3: [text \"abc\"]"
~("\n\x1b[1;5C") -> "took 1: [key down \"enter\", key up \"enter\"]"
~("\n\xc3") -> "took 1: [key down \"enter\", key up \"enter\"]"
~("\r\x08") -> "took 1: [key down \"enter\", key up \"enter\"]"
~("\x00\x08") -> "took 1: [key down \"control\", key down \"`\", key up \"`\", key up \"control\"]"
~("\x00ab\x1b[D") -> "took 1: [key down \"control\", key down \"`\", key up \"`\", key up \"control\"]"
~("\x01\x1bOH") -> "took 1: [key down \"control\", key down \"a\", key up \"a\", key up \"control\"]"
~("\x01\x1b[") -> "took 1: [key down \"control\", key down \"a\", key up \"a\", key up \"control\"]"
~("\x08\x1b[9~") -> "took 1: [key down \"backspace\", key up \"backspace\"]"
~("\x1bOH\n") -> "took 3: [key down \"home\", key up \"home\"]"
~("\x1bOHab\x1b[D") -> "took 3: [key down \"home\", key up \"home\"]"
